        "url": "file:///\\\\deberdna-c010a\\GlobalDE\\DocumentManagement\\Ofs\\obl\\Dokumentenservice\\TeileundStoffe\\Schriftverkehr\\021-2021_01043709_AfTS%20-%20Parting%20film%20non%20porous%20OMat2-131.msg",
