        "url": "file:///\\\\deberdna-c010a\\GlobalDE\\DocumentManagement\\Ofs\\obl\\Dokumentenservice\\TeileundStoffe\\Schriftverkehr\\055-2023_01043995_WG%20Requesting%20Data%20Sheets%20for%20SPHERIGLASS-2029%20%20RRD%20plant%20in%20Dahlewitz%20GER.msg",
